OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA few
OL,6,Fclearer spells across northern and
OL,7,Fwestern parts, especially through the
OL,8,Fevening, but generally a cloudy night
OL,9,Fwith outbreaks of mainly light rain.
OL,10,FWinds continue light and variable.
OL,11,
OL,12,CSaturday:FA cloudy start with
OL,13,Foutbreaks of rain, the rain slowly
OL,14,Fdying out with some brighter or
OL,15,Fsunnier spells developing in the
OL,16,Fafternoon. Light winds.
