OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FRather
OL,6,Fcloudy with some showers on Sunday.
OL,7,FMainly dry Monday with some sunshine.
OL,8,FFog on Sunday and Monday mornings.
OL,9,FMostly bright Tuesday but some rain
OL,10,Flater and freshening southeasterly
OL,11,Fwinds.
